„­bible_version£KJV¤book§chapter¨sections˜…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses–„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙpIn the beginning of the reign of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah came this word from the LORD, saying,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙÚThus saith the LORD; Stand in the court of the LORD's house, and speak unto all the cities of Judah, which come to worship in the LORD's house, all the words that I command thee to speak unto them; diminish not a word:¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ¨if so be they will hearken, and turn every man from his evil way, that I may repent me of the evil, which I purpose to do unto them because of the evil of their doings.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ€And thou shalt say unto them, Thus saith the LORD; If ye will not hearken to me, to walk in my law, which I have set before you,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙto hearken to the words of my servants the prophets, whom I sent unto you, both rising up early, and sending them, but ye have not hearkened;¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙithen will I make this house like Shiloh, and will make this city a curse to all the nations of the earth.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse	¦verses“„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙpSo the priests and the prophets and all the people heard Jeremiah speaking these words in the house of the LORD.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÃ¥lines‘‚¤textÙŞNow it came to pass, when Jeremiah had made an end of speaking all that the LORD had commanded him to speak unto all the people, that the priests and the prophets and all the people took him, saying, Thou shalt surely die.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse	¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙİWhy hast thou prophesied in the name of the LORD, saying, This house shall be like Shiloh, and this city shall be desolate without an inhabitant? And all the people were gathered against Jeremiah in the house of the LORD.¦layout ªlast_verse	…¤book§chapter«first_verse
